# .agents is not plain-stowed; the `agents` target fans its skills into
# ~/.agents/skills and ~/.claude/skills, and links AGENTS.md into ~/.agents.
\.agents
# znap-managed plugin clones (znap itself, ohmyzsh, zsh-users, lukechilds, ...)
# are never stowed: with --no-folding stow would symlink their internals
# file-by-file, .git included, half-breaking the clones. ~/.config/zsh becomes
# a real dir and znap clones plugins straight into it on first shell startup.
^/\.config/zsh/znap
^/\.config/zsh/ohmyzsh
^/\.config/zsh/zsh-users
^/\.config/zsh/lukechilds
